  m_text: "Oscar-Claude Monet was a French painter and the leader of the Impressionist
    movement. His work revolutionized art history and influenced generations of abstract
    painters. Monet was inspired to paint natural light and the open air, and experimented
    with bold colors, unconventional compositions, and loose handling. His mature
    works often depicted the same subject at different times of day in multiple sequences,
    like his series of wheat stacks and Rouen cathedral. \n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
